From 4eba85170fcfee5a5d3de34463acb6fec96865a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mathias <77238760+MathiasMortus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 09:33:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 40/63] Glint: native command palette, Glint settings window,
 glint:// bridge, workspaces, profiles
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ⌘T command palette (chrome/browser/ui/views/glint/): tab + history search,
  URL-or-default-search-engine open, /profile command with suggestions,
  Electron styling, Spotlight placement; works in tabless windows
- ⌘, opens the Glint settings page (extension) as a trusted app popup and
  passes the Glint profile list; app-menu Settings rerouted
- glint:// protocol bridge: palette, set-theme (BrowserColorScheme),
  set-search (TemplateURLService), set-adblock, adblock-settings
- ⌥⌘←/→ switch workspaces (adjacent tab group, wrap, most-recent tab)
- /profile <name> <url>: real on-disk glint-<name> profiles opened as tabs
  in the current window and tab group; tabId->profile-name pushed into the
  Glint UI extension's storage for sidebar badges
